<p id="Thmclaim1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmclaim1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">By direct calculation, we have <math id="Thmclaim1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\rm per}(B_{B_{1}(3,3)})=-8\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>per</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\rm per}(B_{B_{1}(3,3)})=-8\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.
